 "summary": "Not on these pairs. After the close dropped into a bullish order block, price did the same as random entries on 1h and 4h, pooled across BTC, ETH and SOL. The one result that holds up runs the wrong way: on SOL 4h, price did worse than random after these retests, and that holds without its strongest stretch and at 50 and 100 candles.",
 "verdicts": [
  {
   "use": "Buying the retest of a bullish block (1h, 4h)",
   "verdict": "none",
   "text": "Same as random on 1h and 4h, pooled across the three pairs, in uptrends and in downtrends. SOL on 4h alone did worse than random."
  },
  {
   "use": "Buying the retest on daily",
   "verdict": "fragile-worse",
   "text": "Worse than random by 5% after 20 days, but only because of signals between Apr 11, 2022 and Apr 26, 2022. Without them, same as random."
  }
 ],
 "notes": [
  "On 1h the retest gave 3,648 entries in 1,816 separate moves. Twenty candles later they were 0.07% behind random entries, inside the luck band of -0.13% to 0.14%. Each pair landed inside its own band, and so did uptrends and downtrends.",
  "On 4h the same rule gave 863 entries in 474 moves. They trailed random by 0.6% after 20 candles. That sits just inside the band, whose low end is -0.61%.",
  "SOL carries the weak side on 4h. Its retests trailed random by 1.66%, below a band that reached -1.36%. The result holds without its strongest stretch, Aug 15–17, 2022, and at 50 and 100 candles, though not at 10. BTC on 4h was 0.14% ahead of random, inside its band.",
  "On daily the signal is rare: 135 entries in 65 moves. They trailed random by 5% after 20 days, just below the band. Without five signals between Apr 11, 2022 and Apr 26, 2022, the result falls back inside the band, and it is gone at 50 and 100 days. Each pair on its own had too few moves to judge.",
  "Neither regime carries the daily result. In uptrends the daily retest trailed random by 8%, inside a band nearly as wide. In downtrends it was 0.19% behind, also inside.",
  "For a long DCA bot, a close back into a bullish order block did not time entries better than a random candle on 1h or 4h. The take profit and DCA orders do the work there. On SOL 4h, the retest marked weakness that continued, so leave it out as an entry condition there or use it only as a filter beside other conditions. On daily, too few signals fire to read much into it."
 ],
